OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 72, in life-threatening
OL,4,Acondition after two-car crash near
OL,5,Avillage
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 72-year-old woman is in a
OL,8,Flife-threatening condition in hospital
OL,9,Ffollowing a two-car crash on the A73 in
OL,10,FSouth Lanarkshire.
OL,12,FThe collision, which involved a blue
OL,13,FHonda CR-V and a white Volkswagen Golf,
OL,14,Fhappened at about 13:40 on Thursday at
OL,15,Fthe junction with Sherifflats Road near
OL,16,FThankerton village.
OL,18,FThe woman, who was a passenger in the
OL,19,FHonda, was taken to the Queen Elizabeth
OL,20,FUniversity Hospital with the
OL,21,F72-year-old male driver, who was later
OL,22,Fdischarged.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
