OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 72, in life-threatening
OL,4,Acondition after two-car crash near
OL,5,Avillage
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice Scotland said the 34-year-old
OL,8,Fmale driver of the Volkswagen was
OL,9,Ftreated at the scene. He was arrested
OL,10,Fin connection with road traffic
OL,11,Foffences and released pending further
OL,12,Finquiries.
